h Fiend) with extra bosses. FF2: Soul of Rebirth unlocks after the ending. The Bestiary records every enemy seen."}]},{"id":"progress","title":"Progress","widgets":[{"type":"number","label":"FF1 play time (s)","value":"ff1time","format":"secs","when":"ff1"},{"type":"number","label":"FF2 play time (s)","value":"ff2time","format":"secs","when":"ff2"},{"type":"static","text":"FF1 route: Cornelia -> Pravoka (ship) -> Elfheim -> Marsh Cave -> Melmond -> Earth Cave (Lich) -> Crescent Lake -> Gurgu Volcano (Marilith) -> Ice Cave (airship) -> Sunken Shrine (Kraken) -> Flying Fortress (Tiamat) -> Temple of Chaos."}]}],"notes":"gbaverify 2026-10-25, FF1 new game: game byte 0 = FF1, party list reads Warrior/Thief/White Mage/Black Mage LV1 HP 35/30/33/25 and gil 500 after the party screen (garbage before). FF2 side NOT verified. FF1 party struct stride 0x48 from 0x020026D9; FF2 party stride 0x80 from 0x02001F30."}
